{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43507","headline":"秋风生桂枝 · 无名氏","name":"秋风生桂枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒桂秋风动，萧萧自一枝。\n方将击林变，不假舞松移。\n散翠幽花落，摇青密叶离。\n哀猨惊助褭，花露滴争垂。\n遗韵连波聚，流音万木随。\n常闻小山里，逋客最先知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}